---
import Policy from "../components/Policy.astro";
import { contactEmail } from "../data/policy";
---

<Policy title="Privacy Policy" description="What Rebound Lab collects (almost nothing), what Cloudflare processes, and how to reach us.">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    Rebound Lab has no accounts, no sign-in and no forms. We do not ask for, collect or store personal information through
    the site.
  </p>

  <h2>What our providers process</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. To deliver pages and protect the site from attacks, Cloudflare processes
    technical information such as your IP address and browser details, as any web host does.
  </p>
  <p>
    We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views. It does not use cookies. We see only totals, such as how many
    times a page was viewed, not who viewed it.
  </p>
  <p>
    How long Cloudflare keeps this information is set by Cloudflare, not by us. See the
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a> and
    <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/">what Cloudflare Web Analytics measures</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>International transfer</h2>
  <p>
    Cloudflare runs servers around the world and may process the information above in the United States and other
    countries outside South Korea. This happens automatically when you load a page, for the purpose of delivering the site
    and counting page views. If you email us, your message is stored by Google (Gmail), which may also process it outside
    South Korea.
  </p>

  <h2>If you email us</h2>
  <p>
    If you write to <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>, we use your email address and message only to
    reply. We delete the conversation within 12 months after our last reply, and we do not share it with anyone. The
    mailbox is hosted by Gmail; see the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>No ads, no selling</h2>
  <p>We do not show ads. We do not sell or share personal information.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    Rebound Lab is not directed to children under 14 (under 13 in the United States). If we learn that a child has sent us
    personal information, for example by email, we will delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask what personal information we hold about you, or ask us to delete it, by emailing
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. In practice, the only personal information we could hold is an
    email you sent us.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, we will update it on this page and change the effective date above.</p>

  <Fragment slot="ko">
    <p>Rebound Lab은 회원가입·로그인·입력 양식이 없고, 사이트를 통해 개인정보를 직접 수집하지 않습니다.</p>
    <p>
      호스팅 업체 Cloudflare가 사이트 제공과 보안을 위해 접속 IP 등을 처리하며, 미국 등 국외에서 처리될 수 있습니다. 방문
      통계(Cloudflare Web Analytics)는 쿠키 없이 페이지 조회 수만 집계합니다.
    </p>
    <p>
      문의 이메일은 답장에만 쓰고, 마지막 답장 후 12개월 안에 삭제하며, 제3자에게 제공하지 않습니다. 메일함은 Gmail(Google)에
      보관됩니다.
    </p>
    <p>만 14세 미만 아동을 대상으로 하지 않습니다. 열람·삭제 요청은 아래 이메일로 보내 주세요.</p>
  </Fragment>
</Policy>
